{"articleNo":"199367","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=199367&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2018 프랑스 유학박람회 행사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.10.10","hit":"5979","attachments":[{"name":"2018 Etudier en France 포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=199367&attachNo=79482"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&lt; 2018 </span></b><b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">프랑스 유학박람회 행사 안내<span lang=\"EN-US\"> &gt;<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">안녕하세요<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">프랑스대사관 교육진흥원</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> Campus France</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">입니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">.<o:p></o:p></font></font></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">오는<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 10</span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">월</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> 27</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">일</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">, </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">프랑스 고등 교육기관 담당자들이 직접 방한하여 한국 학생들을 만나는</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> « 2018 </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">프랑스 유학박람회</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> Etudier en France »</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">가 개최될 예정입니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">.<o:p></o:p></font></font></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">주한 프랑스 대사관 주관으로 개최되는 이번 행사는 다양한 분야의 교육 기관들<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">프랑스 국립대학</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">, </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">상경계·이공계 그랑제꼴</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">, </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">예술 학교</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">, </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">전문 학교</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">) </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">및 어학 기관들이 참여하여 프랑스 고등 교육에 관심있는 학생들에게 공신력 있는 맞춤형 정보를 제공하는 특별한 기회가 될 것입니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\">.<o:p></o:p></font></font></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><font size=\"3\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #2f5597\">일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"> : 2018</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 10</span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">월</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> 27</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">일 토요일</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">, 10</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">시</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">30</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">분</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> - 17</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">시</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">30</font></span><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">분 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><font size=\"3\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #2f5597\">장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"> : </font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">하나금융그룹 명동사옥<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">을지로</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> 1</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">가역</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> 5</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">번 출구</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">), 4</font></span><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">층 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><font size=\"3\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #2f5597\">참가비 </span><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">무료 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><font size=\"3\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #2f5597\">사전 등록 사이트 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">: </font><a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/oK5jW4zl5q6VPaLs2\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">https://goo.gl/forms/oK5jW4zl5q6VPaLs2</font></u></a><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">이번 행사에서는 다음과 같은 프로그램을 제공합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. <o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">•<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">프랑스대사관 교육진흥원</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> Campus France </font></span><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">관계자들이 제공하는 프랑스 고등교육에 대한 전반적인 정보 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-margin-top-alt: auto\"><span style=\"FO